WEBVTT

00:30.690 --> 00:32.330
Can I do, do?

01:39.060 --> 01:41.170
So, this is where she's living.

01:44.100 --> 01:47.210
We'll meet soon, Sister.

01:47.970 --> 01:52.010
Francesca, you'll meet her as well.

01:52.010 --> 01:53.650
Huga.

02:07.920 --> 02:09.730
Thanks for coming!

02:11.960 --> 02:15.500
Well, I think that's everything.

02:15.500 --> 02:19.030
I swear, Hime and my sister abuse me.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.840
You there.

02:21.640 --> 02:24.880
I want to go here. Take me.

02:25.870 --> 02:28.040
I don't have all day, hop to it!

02:28.040 --> 02:29.480
Oh, sure.

02:29.480 --> 02:33.410
Huh? That's Hime's house.

02:33.420 --> 02:35.180
Oh, you know her?

02:35.180 --> 02:37.320
That will save me the trouble of explaining.

02:38.020 --> 02:43.020
She could be one of those assassins
who wants Hime dead.

02:43.690 --> 02:45.890
No, I doubt this little girl...

02:45.890 --> 02:48.260
What are you just standing there for?

02:48.260 --> 02:49.830
Hop to it!

02:49.830 --> 02:51.170
R--Right!

02:54.000 --> 02:58.510
1069, 1070, 1071, 1072...

02:58.510 --> 03:00.640
1073, 1074, 1075, 1076...

03:00.640 --> 03:03.250
1073, 1074, 1075, 1076...

03:03.350 --> 03:08.350
1077, 1078, 1079, 1080...

03:08.350 --> 03:13.350
1081, 1082, 1083, 1084, 1085...

03:14.560 --> 03:18.700
1086, 1087, 1088, 1089...

03:20.600 --> 03:22.400
I can't do this all by myself.

03:22.830 --> 03:25.500
I'll have to ask Hiro to help with the weeding.

03:25.500 --> 03:27.300
I'm back!

03:27.300 --> 03:28.940
Good timing!

03:28.940 --> 03:30.640
Oh, we have company?

03:30.640 --> 03:31.640
Yup!

03:31.640 --> 03:34.090
Okay, I'll put the water on for tea.

03:35.680 --> 03:38.250
Hime, you have visitors!

03:38.250 --> 03:40.380
Visitors? For me?

03:40.380 --> 03:42.020
Yeah!

03:42.920 --> 03:44.860
Sister!

03:45.650 --> 03:47.330
Sherwood...

03:47.720 --> 03:50.930
Sherwood? She's from the Royal Family!

03:51.160 --> 03:52.960
Long time no see!

03:52.960 --> 03:56.060
Sister? So, she's Hime's little sister?

03:56.060 --> 03:57.700
Hey!

03:58.200 --> 03:59.830
Are you from the Royal Family?!

03:59.840 --> 04:01.640
What's it to you?

04:05.710 --> 04:08.240
My name is Liza Wildman.

04:08.240 --> 04:11.910
I'm the daughter of the great werewolf warrior,
Volg Wildman!

04:11.910 --> 04:14.980
On my brother's honor, I will kill you!

04:14.980 --> 04:17.250
Liza, it's not her.

04:17.250 --> 04:19.060
Prepare to die!

04:19.720 --> 04:21.630
Move it, Maid!

04:22.090 --> 04:23.730
Huga.

04:25.430 --> 04:27.070
What?

04:32.370 --> 04:34.370
Liza, you're heavy!

04:36.140 --> 04:39.870
Damn, you stupid android!

04:39.880 --> 04:41.510
Huga.

04:51.750 --> 04:53.320
Flandre!

04:53.320 --> 04:54.960
Huga!

05:02.100 --> 05:03.970
Knock it off, Francesca.

05:04.830 --> 05:08.070
We didn't come here to fight.

05:08.070 --> 05:09.500
Huga.

05:09.500 --> 05:11.170
You stop it too, Flandre.

05:11.170 --> 05:12.810
Huga.

05:13.840 --> 05:16.650
I'm coming inside now, Sister.

05:34.860 --> 05:36.670
Here you go.

05:36.900 --> 05:39.000
She's my youngest sister, Sherwood.

05:39.000 --> 05:42.870
Oh, is that so?
Nice to meet you, Sherwood.

05:42.870 --> 05:47.620
Excuse me?! You are to address
me as Princess Sherwood!

05:48.010 --> 05:50.550
You got it, Sherwood.

06:01.060 --> 06:03.470
Damn it...

06:04.190 --> 06:07.170
Is she really not my brother's enemy?

06:08.060 --> 06:11.340
Damn, I can't tell for sure!

06:11.800 --> 06:12.900
Hey, Liza...

06:12.900 --> 06:14.100
What?!

06:14.100 --> 06:16.640
How many siblings does Hime have?

06:16.640 --> 06:18.680
How the hell would I know?!

06:21.310 --> 06:22.740
Sherwood,

06:22.740 --> 06:26.450
there's no way you came all the way from
the Royal Kingdom just for tea.

06:27.450 --> 06:29.490
What did you come here for?

06:32.920 --> 06:37.460
I know you know the circumstances
our siblings are in.

06:38.230 --> 06:40.560
Oh, I'm aware.

06:40.560 --> 06:44.430
We, the fruit of the King's loins,
are destined to kill each other.

06:44.430 --> 06:47.470
The one who survives becomes the next king.

06:48.070 --> 06:52.480
However, today, I am not here to fight you.

06:52.670 --> 06:55.740
Oh? Then, what for?

06:55.740 --> 06:59.610
I came to form an alliance with you.

06:59.610 --> 07:01.420
An alliance?

07:02.080 --> 07:04.420
For us, the youngest of the king's children,

07:04.420 --> 07:09.030
the only way to survive our fate
is to form an alliance!

07:09.590 --> 07:10.820
Interesting...

07:10.830 --> 07:12.630
What do you say, Sister?

07:12.630 --> 07:17.370
We'll form an alliance and
then go up against the others!

07:17.900 --> 07:19.780
Out with the truth.

07:20.270 --> 07:23.840
You either want to rest, with me protecting you,

07:23.840 --> 07:27.110
or you will act friendly and kill me in my sleep.

07:27.110 --> 07:28.920
Which one is it?

07:30.780 --> 07:35.280
Whatever your plan is, my answer is no.

07:35.280 --> 07:37.550
Now, get the hell out of my house.

07:37.550 --> 07:42.260
Are you throwing me to the curb, Sister?

07:43.490 --> 07:50.500
Are you saying you don't care what becomes
of your beloved little sister?

07:55.670 --> 07:58.310
Your acting is terrible, my little sister.

08:03.580 --> 08:07.850
So, I guess negotiations are
over now, huh, Sister?

08:07.850 --> 08:10.950
That makes us enemies now.

08:10.950 --> 08:13.090
We were born enemies.

08:26.700 --> 08:27.700
Huga.

08:27.700 --> 08:28.840
It's fine.

08:28.840 --> 08:34.120
I knew right from the beginning that she'd
never form an alliance with me.

08:35.680 --> 08:40.220
In the end, we can't run away
from our destiny to fight.

08:41.180 --> 08:42.420
Francesca...

08:42.420 --> 08:44.060
Huga.

09:00.400 --> 09:02.210
Welcome back.

09:03.140 --> 09:05.280
The Princess's younger sister?

09:06.240 --> 09:09.310
Her blood sounds delectable as well.

09:20.090 --> 09:21.900
An alliance, huh?

09:43.610 --> 09:45.520
Knock it off, Hime.

09:51.820 --> 09:55.560
Well now, what shall I make for breakfast?

10:09.900 --> 10:11.710
I'll be back.

10:12.140 --> 10:16.040
Hiro, weed the garden when you get back, okay?

10:16.040 --> 10:17.310
What?

10:17.310 --> 10:20.090
I'm very busy with other tasks.

10:21.250 --> 10:22.580
Weeding, huh?

10:22.580 --> 10:24.390
Have a good day at school!

10:37.170 --> 10:41.340
So, building upon Einstein's Theory of Relativity,

10:41.770 --> 10:45.780
there is no way to prove a relationship
between time and dreams.

10:46.410 --> 10:50.320
I'm going out to buy some things, Mistress!

11:13.970 --> 11:15.350
Is this an earthquake?

11:15.700 --> 11:17.510
No, this is...

11:20.610 --> 11:23.680
A man-eating plant, Triffid!

11:33.620 --> 11:35.600
Sherwood, you little devil.

11:59.850 --> 12:03.020
Man, I have to do the weeding when I get back.

12:03.550 --> 12:05.190
Hiro...

12:06.550 --> 12:08.360
Do you have a minute?

12:08.560 --> 12:10.190
Reiri!

12:11.290 --> 12:13.100
Don't act so frightened.

12:13.800 --> 12:16.930
I have to get home and do the weeding.

12:16.930 --> 12:20.210
I'm going to tell you something nice.

12:21.040 --> 12:24.070
I... I'm in a hurry!

12:24.070 --> 12:25.920
You'll have to excuse me!

12:28.540 --> 12:31.550
And I had something to tell the Princess too.

12:46.090 --> 12:47.560
There's no end in sight!

12:47.560 --> 12:51.370
Relax, the Triffid will wilt once the sun goes down.

12:51.370 --> 12:53.300
Well, that's good.

12:53.300 --> 12:57.100
But I don't want this thing around until sunset!

12:57.110 --> 12:58.570
Agreed.

12:58.570 --> 13:00.040
Flandre!

13:00.040 --> 13:01.680
Huga.

13:04.480 --> 13:06.290
Liza, stay still.

13:12.750 --> 13:15.290
Looks like you escaped being
strangled to death, Liza.

13:15.490 --> 13:19.270
Screw you! You couldn't have cared less
if you had sliced me open!

13:20.600 --> 13:22.400
Admit it!

13:25.270 --> 13:28.270
Man, weeding is gonna be such a pain.

13:34.210 --> 13:35.980
What's that?

13:35.980 --> 13:39.220
How am I going to weed with that there?

13:41.080 --> 13:43.150
Wait, we've got bigger problems.

13:43.150 --> 13:44.790
Hime!

13:50.260 --> 13:50.860
Huga.

13:51.960 --> 13:53.530
Huga?

13:53.530 --> 13:55.160
What's that?

13:55.160 --> 13:56.160
What do you think?

13:56.160 --> 13:57.970
Go for it.

14:07.380 --> 14:09.010
Flandre!

14:09.180 --> 14:10.820
Huga!

14:14.550 --> 14:16.050
Hime!

14:21.290 --> 14:22.930
My...

14:24.190 --> 14:27.260
The parfaits here really are tasty.

14:27.500 --> 14:30.430
No, this pudding :11 Ia mode is the best.

14:30.430 --> 14:32.830
No, it's definitely the chocolate parfait.

14:32.830 --> 14:35.750
No, it's got to be the pudding :11 Ia mode.

15:03.600 --> 15:05.670
Damn you, Sherwood.

15:15.340 --> 15:18.050
Nice to see you, Princess.

15:18.050 --> 15:19.550
Reiri!

15:19.550 --> 15:21.530
Damn! It's the vampire.

15:23.420 --> 15:25.890
What brings you here today?

15:25.890 --> 15:29.290
A simple hello would suffice, you know.

15:29.290 --> 15:32.690
I have something I need to tell you, Hime.

15:32.690 --> 15:35.540
That's what brings me here.

15:36.400 --> 15:40.270
I'm sure it's something we don't need to hear.
Just go away!

15:40.270 --> 15:44.400
Oh no, someone let the animal out of its cage.

15:44.410 --> 15:47.210
Or did the Princess forget to put the leash on you?

15:47.210 --> 15:49.240
Watch your mouth, bitch!

15:49.240 --> 15:52.320
Shall we finish our fight?!

15:53.280 --> 15:55.220
I'd be happy to.

15:55.220 --> 15:58.520
I'll show you just how a dog should behave.

15:58.520 --> 16:02.590
Umm, Reiri, didn't you need to talk to Hime?

16:02.590 --> 16:05.330
Oh, that's right.

16:05.330 --> 16:11.070
Princess, would you like me to tell you where
your sister, Princess Sherwood, is?

16:12.570 --> 16:15.810
Oh, have I overstepped my boundaries?

16:17.140 --> 16:19.810
Reiri, what are you plotting?

16:19.810 --> 16:22.410
I'm not plotting anything.

16:22.410 --> 16:26.510
I just owe you a favor, is all.

16:26.510 --> 16:27.950
And by returning said favor,

16:27.950 --> 16:32.520
you think you can go after my blood again
with no trepidations, don't you?

16:34.660 --> 16:35.720
Very well.

16:35.720 --> 16:38.560
You're gonna trust what that vampire has to say?

16:38.560 --> 16:42.260
Finding Sherwood is priority number one

16:42.260 --> 16:47.300
I want to find her before my siblings kill her.

16:56.010 --> 16:59.750
I wonder if my sister's been
eaten by the Triffid yet?

16:59.750 --> 17:00.750
Huga.

17:00.750 --> 17:04.720
I hope I get to live in that mansion
after she's gone.

17:04.720 --> 17:05.720
Huga.

17:05.720 --> 17:07.530
What's wrong?

17:10.460 --> 17:12.100
Triffid!

17:16.260 --> 17:18.180
What's a Triffid doing here?!

17:22.100 --> 17:26.110
An eye for an eye, a Triffid for a Triffid.

17:26.110 --> 17:28.590
I feel bad for her, Hime.

17:29.210 --> 17:31.080
Feel bad?

17:31.080 --> 17:33.980
She tried to kill me.

17:33.980 --> 17:35.960
This is only natural.

17:36.020 --> 17:37.830
But still...

17:38.690 --> 17:40.490
I feel bad for her!

17:40.490 --> 17:41.520
Hiro!

17:41.520 --> 17:43.330
Let him be.

17:43.660 --> 17:45.640
Bless his innocent heart.

17:53.700 --> 17:55.340
Huga.

18:03.610 --> 18:05.250
Francesca!

18:07.620 --> 18:09.420
Watch out!

18:21.000 --> 18:24.570
He sacrificed himself...

18:24.970 --> 18:27.370
...to save me?

18:27.370 --> 18:30.250
What a brave, young man.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.940
Well, that's a shame.

18:56.860 --> 18:58.810
The sun has set.

18:59.370 --> 19:02.140
Sister...

19:09.040 --> 19:14.650
So, you were never planning on killing me?

19:15.250 --> 19:21.170
You knew that a Triffid can only
survive while the sun is out.

19:22.320 --> 19:24.590
Don't get the wrong idea.

19:24.590 --> 19:26.900
I was just making a wager, is all.

19:28.600 --> 19:31.800
I wanted to see what came first,
you being eaten by the Triffid,

19:31.800 --> 19:34.570
or the Triffid wilting when the sun set.

19:34.570 --> 19:36.410
What's this all about?

19:38.240 --> 19:39.880
Sherwood...

19:41.440 --> 19:43.790
My beloved little sister...

19:47.620 --> 19:49.980
You won the wager.

19:49.980 --> 19:54.520
So, I will form that alliance you spoke about.

19:56.020 --> 20:00.730
You don't stand a chance against
our brothers in this fight.

20:00.730 --> 20:05.200
I don't know how long you'll last,
but let's give it a shot.

20:05.670 --> 20:07.300
Sister...

20:08.770 --> 20:10.580
You're so kind.

20:12.470 --> 20:14.950
My kind, yet stupid, Sister...

20:16.140 --> 20:20.280
Allow me to return the words you offered me.

20:20.280 --> 20:25.280
Someone such as yourself doesn't stand
a chance against our brothers.

20:29.390 --> 20:31.960
I will form that alliance with you.

21:10.130 --> 21:13.010
I did say I'd form an alliance with you.

21:13.430 --> 21:16.270
I will not go back on my word now.

21:16.270 --> 21:17.910
However...

21:18.070 --> 21:21.840
Then, everything's fine, isn't it, Sister?

21:21.840 --> 21:25.020
Umm, Princess Sherwood...

21:25.210 --> 21:27.920
You know that's my servant.

21:28.320 --> 21:33.320
Nope, you're wrong.
I'm making him my very first servant!

21:34.120 --> 21:35.760
Huga?

21:35.820 --> 21:40.230
He put his life on the line to protect me.

21:40.230 --> 21:45.230
That's how much he thinks of me!

21:45.330 --> 21:47.310
U..Umm...

21:47.740 --> 21:50.840
I'll consider giving him to you
if you want him that badly.

21:50.840 --> 21:52.510
Hime!

21:52.510 --> 21:56.410
Please do so, Sister.

21:56.410 --> 22:01.250
Hime! Why are you keeping me alive exactly?!

22:01.250 --> 22:05.960
You shall become a Royal Family soldier
and serve me forever!

22:06.590 --> 22:08.230
Hiro!

23:45.120 --> 23:46.750
I feel like something's going to pop out.

23:46.750 --> 23:48.050
Huga!

23:48.060 --> 23:50.220
Don't scare me like that, Flandre!

23:50.220 --> 23:51.290
There's something here.

23:51.290 --> 23:54.360
Geez, you're scaring me on purpose too.

23:54.360 --> 23:55.360
How could you...

23:55.360 --> 23:58.830
No, there's something in this hospital.

24:00.770 --> 24:02.500
I can sense it.

24:02.500 --> 24:04.800
Next episode, "Princess Electric Shock"

24:04.810 --> 24:07.470
Are you going to wear tiger-striped
clothes too, Hime?

24:07.470 --> 24:07.770
What are you talking about?

24:08.740 --> 24:10.280
Huga, huga.
